.pnp.*
**/.yarn/*
!.yarn/patches
!.yarn/plugins
!.yarn/releases
!.yarn/versions

# testing
**/coverage/

# next.js (Sangat Penting: Menggunakan **/ agar mendeteksi di sub-folder)
